    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "With SmartSettings, there's no need to fumble around anymore with unlocking your car, adjusting the mirrors, seats, music, and more - all you need is your phone. SmartSettings automatically detects when you're walking to your car, unlocks it when you get to it, and adjusts the settings in your car to your personal specifications and mood even before you open the door. SmartSettings automatically\r\ncustomizes the physical conditions, entertainment, and navigation system of your next shared or\r\nrented car to your preferences, without the need to push a button, turn a dial, or utter a\r\ncommand. Using the unique profile data on your smartphone, SmartSettings communicates with\r\nyour new car and adjusts its settings to make your in-car environment a more intuitive and\r\npersonal one.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Chang, Cindy, Lao Thao, Matthew Mau, and Roxana Gharegozlou. (2013). Smart Settings. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at http://purl.stanford.edu/jq426sq3127.",
            "type": "preferred citation",
